mestamp":1786608919158331001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Removed the blocks link to the epic: it had served its purpose as the discovery flag, but with the condensation applied it only created a circular gate (epic review fast-fails on the unclosed blocker; this ticket's close verifies the epic's PASS). Resolution record stays here; proceeding to verify AC2-AC4.","timestamp":1786610320458832001}],"created_at":1786608150827754001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2adfd441-fe77-4caf-ab10-103c8c43b3b0","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"4631-5598-7127-4a56"}],"description":"## Problem (resolved during this ticket's lifetime — this ticket now verifies the fix)\n\nEpic `0e68-41eb-5782-4336` (outrageous-uncultured-wildebeast) had a 10,135-character description,\nover the 8,000-char review admission cap (`7cf80009d9`). `review-plan` on the epic returned a single\nblocking P4 admission finding without running the LLM, so the epic could not earn a plan-review\nattestation — and the parent-first claim cascade therefore blocked EVERY child of the epic\n(discovered when `bloated-shadeful-lamprey`'s claim failed with \"Parent error: no certified\nplan-review attestation\").\n\n## State at planning time\n\nThe epic's description has ALREADY been condensed by the session owner: the description field now\nmeasures 7389 characters (under the cap), and the full 10,135-char original is preserved verbatim as\nan epic comment dated 2026-08-13. Editing the epic changes only the epic's OWN material fingerprint —\nchildren's attestations bind their own material (material_diff.material_basis), not the parent's, so\nno sibling attestation was invalidated by the edit.\n\n## Remaining work (verification only; no further edits prescribed)\n\nRun the epic's plan review to earn the certified PASS the cascade requires, then prove the cascade\nis unblocked with a child claim.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `0e68-41eb-5782-4336`'s description field measures at most 8,000 characters; checked by reading the field and reporting the measured length.\n- [ ] `rebar review-plan 0e68-41eb-5782-4336` admits the plan — no P4 admission finding in the result; checked by inspecting the review output's blocking list.\n- [ ] `rebar review-plan 0e68-41eb-5782-4336` returns a certified PASS with zero blocking findings and a persisted, signed plan-review attestation (checked with `--status`; if a PASS fails to persist, `rebar sign-review` is the recovery), before the claim check below.\n- [ ] A child of the epic can be claimed without the parent cascade failing; checked by `rebar claim bloated-shadeful-lamprey` exiting 0 (its own plan-review attestation is already certified and its material unchanged).\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["blocks","0e68-41eb-5782-4336"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"ticket-store edit only: shortens epic 0e68's description; no repository file changes","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"cf95f500-8e72-4264-96f6-3476eba660d8","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"98f7-28b9-b39a-4ca2","ticket_type":"story","title":"Oversized epic description blocks the parent-first claim cascade","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5449db57-4843-4939-976a-1d4472afe45d","dc527420-c15b-4d60-bd62-a592f720833e","a128a5d9-ef2a-4525-8115-d6e49b46c0a8","2adfd441-fe77-4caf-ab10-103c8c43b3b0","61dc4a3e-f609-4bbf-ae01-a234e6bb0e55","507406a7-b6d9-4d3b-8844-c750d57d58fb","ca7112db-f41b-4151-be9f-db72ce71964b","58e122a5-d50e-4efd-a9d6-8fd2f532da07","cf95f500-8e72-4264-96f6-3476eba660d8","66028aa8-e750-4973-bd87-9fc606b5ec9d","2430c8c6-f915-43f3-b0eb-a48f0a195c83","11cf09cd-c974-4cd1-898e-c612e882c60b"]},